//　頬を赤くする娘に、弥源太老人は快さげに笑う。
//　……この団欒。ふと、今の状況を忘れてしまいそう
//になる。

//　赤面したまま俯いて、上の娘は包みを広げた。
//　
//　……？

//　内容に、随分と差がある。
//　半分は小さめの、綺麗な形をした握り飯だが、もう
//半分は格段に大雑把、かつ豪快な姿。
  Old Yagenta chuckles merrily as his granddaughter turns beet red. Surrounded by this happy family, I feel in danger of forgetting who I am and why I'm here.

  The still-blushing Fuki unwraps the parcel of food and offers it to me, all the while refusing to look me in the eye.

  ...Oh? The contents are unexpectedly diverse. About half the onigiri are small and nicely shaped, while the other half make up for in size what they lack in beauty.

